<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Clayton Homes cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Clayton Homes cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co analyst David Kerdell downgraded Oakwood Homes Corp and Clayton Homes Inc to market perform from buy, according to a market source.</p>
<p>-- analyst declined immediate comment.</p>
<p>-- Clayton fell 5/8 to 13-3/4, while Oakwood dropped 5/8 to 20-3/4.</p>
</text>
